      "created_at": "2013-01-03T01:48:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Actually, what it says is \"If Apostate <em>would be</em> reduced to 0 or fewer HP...\" That means that his HP is not reduced and you do the other stuff (flipping and destroying a relic) <em>instead</em>. I'm not sure why what they have against the word \"instead,\" but if you add it in your head every time you see the word \"would\" in this game, it will make more sense.</p>",
